  "long_description": "Middesk is the business identity platform that financial institutions, payments companies and marketplaces rely on to grow with confidence. Every business leaves a trail of signals; Formation records. Tax filings. Ownership data. Registered agents. Officers. Risk indicators. \r\n\r\nMiddesk quiets that noise. We resolve it into a coherent, continuously updated view of each business, enabling teams to make clear decisions and keep moving. \r\n\r\nTrusted by the likes of Brex, Mercury, Plaid, and Affirm, Middesk helps the fastest-growing platforms in financial services establish trust with the businesses they serve. From the first onboarding decision through every change that follows. \r\n\r\nWith offices in SF and NY, Middesk is backed by Sequoia Capital, Accel Partners, and Y Combinator.",
